{
 "about": "The quest restrictions (body.conditionNote, body +0x2c) the quest builder offers, with our own names. The ids are the 136 Pax's quest editor names (its 239 read as 47, Light Bowgun only); the API accepts exactly these (QuestCodec.CONDITION_NOTES, compared by dev/check-quest-fields.js). A restriction with confirmedBy has a second source: the live quests that use it (survey of the 5,000 live quest files, 2026-11-09); the others rest on Pax's name alone and the builder marks them unconfirmed. The game shows the note on the quest info page; which ones it also enforces is not traced one by one (hvmhfz_re 0x10aeae10, 0x10b0c170). None was tested in game here.",
 "updated": "2026-11-09",
 "hardcore": {
  "ids": [
   109,
   110,
   111,
   112,
   113,
   118
  ],
  "written": 109,
  "questClass": 3,
  "about": "Hardcore: with one of these notes the client sets its Hardcore quest state (hvmhfz_re 0x1047d500) and the monsters of a class 3 (HR 100 and up) quest take their Hardcore data (0x1087b4e0; docs/quest-classes.md part 75). 240 live class 3 quests have one (109 in 208 files). The builder's Hardcore switch writes 109; the API refuses these ids in any other class."
 },
